translate schinese_rewrite Scene_Werewolf_Gangbang_07375be3:

    e "F操,这对我来说太大了..."

translate schinese_rewrite Scene_Werewolf_Gangbang_0a4aa73b:

    ww4 "但在此之前,我等不及要摧毁你那珍贵的小洞了。"

