translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_b9bea9b8:

    "他的眼睛朝你闪烁着抗议的一瞬间,。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_31bd0ac8:

    e "少管闲事,我说没说之前,你不敢把它拉回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_d19e1245:

    "里巴的喉咙发出一点沮丧的声音,舌头仍然伸长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_ff15710c:

    "他的脸颊在毛皮下被烧黑,每秒钟他都拿着淫荡的姿势,感觉就像一场战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_b123402c:

    "你可以看到他肩膀的紧张——他正试图以每一寸的方式与指挥部作战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_2ae1bdf3:

    rb "是的..."

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_acdf9c23:

    "里巴的舌头流出 顺畅的和细微的 没有任何阻力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_8c6783ed:

    "慢慢地拖着它穿过嘴唇 看着人群。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_8ca0aa55:

    "他的表情是嬉戏的,是无耻的,是享受表演的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_710a9a7a:

    e "好孩子 给他们弄点湿润的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_24c1cc5c:

    "一个愿意听话的软软的哼哼 在他的舌头周围震动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_085d3c07:

    "他甚至倾斜头部,让前排更清楚地看他的舌头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_45f50055:

    "群众欢呼着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_0d1eae15:

    "你坚持命令几秒钟 观察他的反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_ca306b80:

    "控制器终于释放了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_9a2dc5c6:

    rb "……真丢人。"
translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_79f2bf5e:

    "他的声音很紧 仍然带着违抗的痕迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_2f1023fa:

    rb "怎么样 他们的气味上升了 不是..."

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Lick_fa2d6f4c:

    "他的语气很柔软,渴望得到批准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_e9a8e0ab:

    e "说吧 里巴 告诉整个人群你到底属于谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_e6114245:

    "里巴的嘴巴张开,但话语好像在喉咙里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_4f70174a:

    rb "我不是说在..."

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_903b2b38:

    "他的嘴快闭上了 反抗在他的眼里燃烧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_ec1870c5:

    "控制器又把嘴唇分开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_766fadae:

