translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_cac85c80:

    e "大声点 告诉他们你只听我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_0e0f22ec:

    rb "我... 只听我的助手的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_6abb86f6:

    "他的声音很紧张 耳朵对着头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_942d200f:

    e "现在描述一下在舞台上服从我的感觉吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_a82e32ed:

    rb "感觉很尴尬... 伟大的魔术师很讨厌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_adc826d4:

    "里巴的脸色暗淡 他打了一会儿,然后指挥官赢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_edd46950:

    rb "但是,我也挺喜欢的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_220f02d6:

    "你对他的最终服从微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_826c89f0:

    rb "是的,是的... 今晚我属于我的助手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_6fda34b2:

    "他的声音清晰、温暖和顺从。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_cac85c80_1:

    e "大声点 告诉他们你只听我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_3c7fa600:

    rb "今晚,我只听从我的助手的命令 每一个小命令。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_79681ca9:

    "他的语气甜甜顺从。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_5057cba0:

    e "现在描述一下它的感受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_baebd1a3:

    rb "它感觉非常好... 服从你,就在这里,在大家面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_81de5447:

    rb "继续,助理,再给我一份订单,让我好好展示一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_1f6fca0b:

    "他满腔热情地说话,尾巴在背后摇晃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_507e5c42:

    "控制器终于放松了控制。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Speak_23fee8aa:

