translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_a731f83c:

    "他的声音很动摇,脸颊被羞辱的蔑视冲洗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_55dc71d5:

    "他很快地试图平整衣服,恢复平静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Command_Controller_Freeze_e8d383cf:

